# graphify knowledge graph
# Version only the semantic cache (LLM token investment) + the human report.
# Everything else (AST cache, graph.json/html, dotfiles, dated snapshots) is
# regenerable for free with `/graphify --update` — no LLM tokens spent.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cache/*
!graphify-out/cache/semantic/
